---
import ChurnMicroIcon from "./ChurnMicroIcon.astro";

const parts = [
  ["Plan", "会员层级与支付安排", "filter"],
  ["Usage", "使用频率、时段与间隔", "data"],
  ["Service", "等待、故障与支持记录", "validation"],
  ["Payment", "支付失败与退款请求", "error"],
  ["App", "崩溃、版本与互动状态", "code"],
] as const;
---

<figure class="observation-anatomy">
  <figcaption>
    <span>DATA / 00</span>
    <div>
      <h3>一条记录先描述一个客户状态，再承接一个结果</h3><p>
        每个 observation 把计划、使用、服务、支付和应用体验放在同一行，随后用 retained
        或 churned 标记该行的结果。
      </p>
    </div>
  </figcaption>
  <div
    class="observation-anatomy__map"
    role="img"
    aria-label="客户观察由计划、使用、服务、支付和应用体验组成，并对应 retained 或 churned 结果"
  >
    <div class="observation-anatomy__customer">
      <ChurnMicroIcon name="data" decorative /><strong>Customer</strong><small
        >一条客户观察</small
      >
    </div>
    <div class="observation-anatomy__inputs">
      {
        parts.map(([title, detail, icon]) => (
          <div>
            <>
              <ChurnMicroIcon name={icon} decorative />
              <strong>{title}</strong>
              <small>{detail}</small>
            </>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <div class="observation-anatomy__outcome">
      <ChurnMicroIcon name="prediction" decorative /><strong>Outcome</strong><span
        >retained / churned</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="observation-anatomy__reading">
    churned 被设为事件类别，因此 Sensitivity
    只计算真实流失客户中被正确识别的比例；Specificity
    则只计算真实留存客户中被正确排除的比例。事件方向先固定，四项指标才使用同一口径。
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .observation-anatomy {
    margin: 0;
  }
  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  figcaption > span {
    width: max-content;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--colour-primary-strong);
    font: 700 0.7rem/1 var(--font-mono);
  }
  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h3 {
    max-width: 28ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  figcaption p,
  .observation-anatomy__reading {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }
  .observation-anatomy__map {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(9rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(9rem, 0.8fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--colour-border);
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
  }
  .observation-anatomy__customer,
  .observation-anatomy__outcome,
  .observation-anatomy__inputs > div {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    background: var(--colour-surface);
  }
  .observation-anatomy__customer,
  .observation-anatomy__outcome {
    justify-items: start;
  }
  .observation-anatomy__inputs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--colour-border);
  }
  .observation-anatomy__map :global(svg) {
    color: var(--colour-accent);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .observation-anatomy__map strong {
    color: var(--colour-text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .observation-anatomy__map small,
  .observation-anatomy__outcome span {
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .observation-anatomy__outcome {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--colour-accent);
  }
  .observation-anatomy__reading {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--colour-accent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .observation-anatomy__map {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .observation-anatomy__inputs {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    figcaption {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .observation-anatomy__inputs {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
